==History==
2019
*The Battle Healer was made available before its general release on 2/12/2019 via the [[Trophies|Trophy Road]]. She was also available in a [[Tournament/Special Event Challenges|Special Challenge]] as a reward for reaching 5 wins.
*On 3/12/2019, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (3/12/2019)|maintenance break]], changed the Battle Healer's card description. It used to say, “''With each attack, she unleashes a powerful healing aura that restores Hitpoints to friendly Troops. Outside of combat she passively heals herself!''”
2020
*The Battle Healer [[Cards|card]] was generally released on 6/1/2020.
*On 7/4/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/4/2020)|Balance Update]], added the Battle Healer as a Trophy Road reward.
*On 5/5/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (5/5/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Battle Healer's hitpoints by 10%.
*On 31/8/2020, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20II%20Update%20(31/8/2020)|Clan Wars II Update]], added the Healing statistic on the Battle Healer's card info screen. It also made it so that [[Clone|cloned]] [[:Category:Troop Cards|troops]] can no longer be healed by the Battle Healer.
*On 6/10/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2020)|Balance Update]], allowed the Battle Healer to hover, meaning she can cross the river and will collide with air troops instead of ground troops.
*On 18/11/2020, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Improvement%20Update%20(18/11/2020)|Clan Wars Improvement Update]], changed the hover mechanic. The Battle Healer would no longer pass through [[:Category:Building Cards|buildings]], push back air troops, or bounce off the river when knocked back.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Battle Healer from Spooky Town to Legendary Arena.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022 
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Battle Healer from Legendary Arena to Frozen Peak.
2023
*On 6/6/2023, a [[Version History#Balance%20Changes%20(6/6/2023)|Balance Update]], allowed the Battle Healer to deal Spawn Healing.
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14). It also added the Walk It Off [[Card Mastery]] task for the Battle Healer.
2024
*On 19/6/2024, a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (19/6/2024)|maintenance break]], removed the Battle Healer's Passive Healing.
*On 2/10/2024, the [[Version History#Lucky Drops 2.0 Update (2/10/2024)|Lucky Drops 2.0 Update]], made it so that Battle Healer would no longer be immune to [[Earthquake]] and [[Royal Giant/Evolution|Evolved Royal Giant]]'s recoil. The "''When she isn't attacking, she passively heals herself!''" words from her description were also removed.
2025
*On 31/3/2025, the [[Version History#2025 Quarter 1 Update (31/3/2025)|2025 Quarter 1 Update]], increased the Battle Healer's healing by 0.99% and her spawn healing by 0.49%.
2026

* On 4/8/2026, a Balance Update, increased the Battle Healer's damage by 81%, increased her hit speed to 2 seconds (from 1.5 seconds), decreased her heal radius to 3 tiles (from 4 tiles), decreased her heal area to 28.3 square tiles (from 50.3 square tiles), and made it to where she can no longer hear herself nor other Battle Healers

