==Trivia==
*The Battle Healer resembles [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Archangel archangels], an order of angels that is depicted as more warrior-like, with duties of protecting and healing.
**In the Spanish, Italian, Russian, Portuguese, and Vietnamese language settings of the game, the Battle Healer's name translates to "Warrior Healer". In the French, Turkish, Chinese, Thai, and Finnish language settings of the game, the Battle Healer's name translates to "Army Healer", "Healer", "Battle Angel", "Action Healer", and "Combat Healer" respectively.
*The Battle Healer is the first [[Cards|card]] to use the [[Pass Royale|Level Boost]] mechanic, where players can use the card at the Level equal to their own [[Experience|King Level]] for one Season.
*The Battle Healer is the only winged troop that is not actually flying.
*The heal effect sound she produces every time she hits is a high-pitched version of the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zPqwPevGxwo&t=126s old Healing Spell sound] from Clash of Clans.
*The Battle Healer, along with the [[Archers]], [[Goblins]], [[Barbarians]], [[Musketeer]], [[Wizard]], [[Hog Rider]], [[Witch]], [[Miner]], [[Ice Wizard]], and [[Bandit]], are featured as a [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Squaddies Squaddie] in [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Squad_Busters_Wiki Squad Busters].
*There is a [[Loading Screen Hints|Loading Screen Hint]] that says "''The Battle Healer's older sister can heal entire villages''". This might be a reference to the [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Healer Healer] in Clash of Clans.
*If 2 pairs of Battle Healers face each other, it will end up in an endless [[Basics of Battle|battle]]. This can happen if the Battle Healers are close enough to heal each other but not so close that 1 Battle Healer is targeted by 2 Battle Healers. This is because the amount of healing that both Battle Healers do is higher than the amount of damage that the opposing Battle Healer will deal.
*The icon of the "Healer" [[Card Mastery]] task resembles a [[Heal]] [[:Category:Spell Cards|spell]].
*The Battle Healer is the subject of 4 [[Emotes]].
*Before the Battle Healer's card release, she was going to be released alongside the hovering mechanic. However, it was pulled back when a bug that made her invulnerable to ground-targeting splash such as [[Mega Knight]] and [[Sparky]] was discovered.

